  "description": "The types zazzle-llm declares. Cli and Cmd are the clap command line; PromptArgs carries prompt's options to the function that runs it, which builds an Ask for the engine. Model is one catalogue entry, and Want the download built from it; Defaults is the saved model and effort; Lock holds a flock while a model downloads. Turn is what the chat template is given; Event and Done are what generation reports; Filter splits the reported text into Piece values. The test-only Tmp directory in store.rs is left out.",
